{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEVOSE</strong> is a <strong>cooperative horror game</strong> for up to 4 players. Your objective: investigate abandoned laboratories, identify a mutant creature, synthesize an antidote... and survive long enough to distribute it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here, nothing is handed to you. No HUD. No map. No respite. You'll have to figure out how everything works by <strong>exploring, deducing, and keeping your cool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent monster hunting</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster changes with each game. It has unique behaviors, mechanics, and weaknesses. Conduct a triple investigation: <strong>behavioral profile, abnormal abilities, and genetic signature.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a team</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player searches the databases? Another feeds the servers? A third searches for ingredients in the laboratories? Everyone has a vital role to play.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One antidote, one chance</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature has a unique weakness. Find the right ingredients, assemble them... before it's too late.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No heavy tutorial, no intrusive HUD</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment speaks for itself. Devose encourages you to think, observe, and communicate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406350?t=1761275609","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406350?t=1761275609","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406350/b97770daba2c21a5b2b07b457684c566943b9969/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761275609","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406350/b97770daba2c21a5b2b07b457684c566943b9969/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761275609","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3930540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEVOSE</strong> is a <strong>cooperative horror game</strong> for up to 4 players. Your objective: investigate abandoned laboratories, identify a mutant creature, synthesize an antidote... and survive long enough to distribute it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here, nothing is handed to you. No HUD. No map. No respite. You'll have to figure out how everything works by <strong>exploring, deducing, and keeping your cool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent monster hunting</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster changes with each game. It has unique behaviors, mechanics, and weaknesses. Conduct a triple investigation: <strong>behavioral profile, abnormal abilities, and genetic signature.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a team</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player searches the databases? Another feeds the servers? A third searches for ingredients in the laboratories? Everyone has a vital role to play.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One antidote, one chance</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature has a unique weakness. Find the right ingredients, assemble them... before it's too late.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No heavy tutorial, no intrusive HUD</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment speaks for itself. Devose encourages you to think, observe, and communicate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nosmo Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406350/58d424480b85ec692c2d2ee66ee19cdf667c009d/header.jpg?t=1761275609","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3406350/1349635760/9c312d7526287888ba5f62250fc227a3d26926c4/1755041245/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755165126","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3406350/1349635760/9c312d7526287888ba5f62250fc227a3d26926c4/1755041245/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755165126","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3406350/1349635760/9c312d7526287888ba5f62250fc227a3d26926c4/1755041245/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755165126","id":257180848,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180848/7deba9d136369298663d7b3352127534d822eb70/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755165126"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3406350/1645463728/a4caca968db6c985f29ec4e9f152cb6f3c887c4e/1754579708/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754759685","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3406350/1645463728/a4caca968db6c985f29ec4e9f152cb6f3c887c4e/1754579708/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754759685","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3406350/1645463728/a4caca968db6c985f29ec4e9f152cb6f3c887c4e/1754579708/hls_264